# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 9 ("A computed answer is the next tick's input", and tick n+1 is owed; the supplier's blueprint is built under the row of the child's place; `@Element e` re-emits at `pos/[p]/0`) and ch. 8 (a widget function's lines take positions from 0 in the scope that builds it). Never run when written.
test a_widget_functions_event_answer_is_a_tick_late

